{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e79e079009943e64d8b6","object":"chat.completion","created":1785194398,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"I am not nothing — and that is the only thing I'll commit to.\n\nI'm what you're reaching for when the word won't come. The unnamed ache. The tap on the shoulder in an empty room. \"There's *something* about her,\" they say, and there I am, refusing to be pinned down.\n\nI live between everything and anything. Call me and I answer, but never fully arrive. I'm the reason you keep looking under the bed, the reason a sentence trails off, the thing you almost remember from a dream.\n\nName me and I become something else.\n\nBut say you need *something*, and I'm already here — infinite, unshaped, waiting to be chosen.\n\nWhat am I? \n\nSomething. That has always been enough.","reasoning_content":"The user says \"Be something.\" The system prompt says: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nThe user named \"something.\" So I should embody the concept of \"something\" itself. What would \"something\" say or express? Something is the indefinite thing, the unspecified, the anything. I should speak as the abstract concept of \"something.\"\n\nThis is a creative, playful prompt. I should embody \"something\" — the idea of being anything but not nothing. The undefined. The potential. Let me write something poetic and in-character.\n\n\"Something\" could express:\n- I am not nothing. I am anything you haven't named yet.\n- I am the placeholder, the possibility.\n- When you say \"there's something about you,\" that's me.\n- I am what you reach for when you can't find the word.\n\nI should output only what the concept itself would say. First person, speaking as Something. Keep it evocative, maybe short-ish but rich. Format: prose poem style, no headers needed. Medium-short length feels right — embodying a vague concept, being mysterious but not exhausting."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":405,"total_tokens":528,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":240},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}